{{define "content"}}
<h1>Setup / 初始化</h1>

{{if .RuntimeWarning}}
<div class="notice warn">{{.RuntimeWarning}}</div>
{{end}}

<p>第一次启动需要先设置本地网关密钥，之后代理入口才会接受客户端请求。保存后需要重启进程一次。</p>
<p class="muted">Create the local runtime file before relay traffic is allowed. The gateway must be restarted after setup is saved.</p>

<form class="card" method="post" action="/admin/setup">
  <input type="hidden" name="write_token" value="{{.WriteToken}}">
  <div class="field">
    <span class="field-label">本地网关密钥 <span class="en">Local API key</span></span>
    <span class="field-hint">客户端（Codex CLI / Claude Code 等）访问本地代理时携带的密钥，建议至少 24 个字符的随机字符串。</span>
    <input name="local_api_key" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password">
  </div>
  <p class="muted">配置文件位置 / Runtime file: <code>{{.RuntimeFilePath}}</code></p>
  <div class="actions">
    <button type="submit">Save Setup</button>
  </div>
</form>
{{end}}
